"""Islamiat (Ikhtiari) XII PDF54: pp.98–99 — wahy matlu/ghayr matlu; authority and importance of Hadith (An-Nisa 80, Al-Hashr 7, An-Najm 3-4). Run: python class12_iski_page054.py"""
